-1 GUILDS_CHANGES~
03.18.09 - Corrected an issue that caused anyone with mana, hp, or moves greater
           than 12768 to have that stat reset to 0 when using the Psi Ring regen
           command.  This issue was reported by and the fix designed by Baghtru.  (Order)~

0 GUILDS 'SPECIALIZED GUILDS'~
{160}Specialized Guilds

Specialized guilds go a step beyond classes.  Based on an individual's
class, he/she may attempt to join a specialized guild.  These allow for
a better role-playing atmosphere, but do not interfere at all with the
ability to multi-play.  Each guild offers new and exciting options for the
players, but a lot is expected of the players that decide to join.

  (A) {140}Adventurer's Guild{160}                 (D) {100}Circle of the Black Lotus
{160}  (B) {120}Survivalist's Guild{160}                (E) {130}Psionicist's Guild
{160}  (C) {170}League of the White Rose{160}           (F) {110}Order of the Jagged Knife
{160}
  (G) All the mottos of the guilds       (-) Back{300}

Updated September 29, 1998 by Jaxom

