   |{147}                       The Adventurer's Guild                        {000}|
   |{147}                                                                     {000}|
   |{147}  The adventurer's guild is the easiest of the specialized guilds.   {000}|
   |{147}        The requirement is merely to be level 20 or higher.          {000}|
   |{147} Once you join, you'll be able to obtain 75 tokens hidden throughout {000}|
   |{147}    the realm.  You can take the tokens to the main office of the    {000}|
   |{147}       guild and get a chance to spin the wheel of adventure.        {000}|
   |{147} The drawback is:  Once you find all 75 tokens, you can't get more.  {000}|
   |{107}_____________________________________________________________________{000}|{300}

