   |{147}                       The Survivalist's Guild                        {000}|
   |{147}                                                                      {000}|
   |{147}          The survivalist's guild is a more difficult guild.          {000}|
   |{147}               To join, you must be level 25 or higher.               {000}|
   |{147}   Being a survivalist, you don't care very much for the comforts of  {000}|
   |{147}    a nice bed, or a hot meal.  You like to live in the wilderness,   {000}|
   |{147}  and live off the land.  Everything you need to survive you can find {000}|
   |{147}   outdoors, whether it be food, water, or herbs for healing salves.  {000}|
