   |{147}      The league of the white rose is a very restricting guild.       {000}|
   |{147}     To join, you must have at least 30 levels in the monk class.     {000}|
   |{147}   As a healer, you care for others more than yourself.  And to you,  {000}|
   |{147}  being good to your fellow man ensures greater rewards when you die. {000}|
   |{147}   Therefore, you steer away from evil, and concentrate on the good   {000}|
   |{147}     around you.  Joining the guild gives you help in this task.      {000}|
