   |{147}      The order of the jagged knife is simply an addition for the     {000}|
   |{147}   assassin class, which is only open to pure assassins, level 36+.   {000}|
   |{147}    This guild allows you to accept contracts from players of the     {000}|
   |{147}     realm.  Once a player issues his contract to the guild, any      {000}|
   |{147}  assassin can attempt to fulfil that contract.  The first to do so   {000}|
   |{147}    will receive the posted reward.  No other players can see the     {000}|
   |{147}  contracts.  Only the assassins of the order.  The longer a player   {000}|
   |{147} stays in the order the better.  For eventually he will construct his {000}|
   |{147} own powerful, jagged knife.  This is the only guild with two ways to {000}|
   |{147} leave: reincarnate, or multi-class.  Multi-classing will result in   {000}|
   |{147}          the loss of access to the guild, and the knife.             {000}|
