0 SURVIVALIST LOCATE SEARCH FIND PURIFY PREPARE~
The locate    command allows you to hunt for food.
The search    command allows you to look for herbs.
The find      command allows you to look for water.
The purify    command lets you purify any unclean water you find.
The prepare   command lets you combine herbs and water for a healing salve.
The upgrade   command lets you upgrade your guild band.
The companion command lets you search for a companion.~
0 'LEAGUE OF THE WHITE ROSE' SERVANT FRIEND SPELLS PROTECT~
The servant   command calls upon a holy servant to assist you.
The upgrade   command lets you upgrade your guild band
The protect   alias asks the servant to stand guard for you.
The heal      alias asks the servant to cast heal upon you.
The sanctuary alias asks the servant to cast sanctuary upon you.
The spells    alias asks the servant to cast all its spells on you.
The friend    alias asks the servant to cast its spells on a companion.
The sanctify  alias asks the servant to cast sanctify on the room.~
0 'CIRCLE OF THE BLACK LOTUS' SERPENT WATCH AWAY~
The serpent command summons an evil serpent to do your bidding.
The upgrade command lets you upgrade your guild band
            (Note that the serpent may on occasion disobey you.)
The blast   alias tells the serpent to cast spells on you.
The watch   alias tells the serpent to keep an eye out for intruders.
The away    alias tells the serpent to carry you away.
The team    alias tells the serpent to follow you.~
0 PSIONICIST MEDITATE REGENERATE~
The psi-check  command displays your current psionic potential.
The meditate   command helps restore mana/move while resting.      (costs  5)
The gate       command is similar to the teleport skill.           (costs 10)
The regenerate command restores hp/mana/move to full while resting.(costs 15)
The wall       command protects the mind and increases success.    (costs 20)
The storm command causes a psionic storm to appear.                (costs 25)
The strike <victim> command causes the storm to attack someone.    (costs  5)~
