1 ADVMOTTO~
{140}The Adventurer's Guild motto:

   'To kill is to live life to the fullest,
    to live a full life includes love,
    to love is to give your heart away,
    to give away your heart is to tempt death,
    to die is the ultimate adventure.'
    
  (-) Back{300}

{-}GUILDMOTTOS 'GUILD MOTTOS'
~
1 SURMOTTO~
{120}The Survivalist's Guild motto:

   'The land provides everything for survival,
    survival is the key to life,
    life is the reason of our existence,
    our existence is the key to a better future.'

  (-) Back{300}

{-}GUILDMOTTOS 'GUILD MOTTOS'
~
1 LWRMOTTO~
{170}The League of the White Rose's Motto:

   'All good lives are sacred,
    all sacred lives should endure,
    all enduring lives, if dedicated to good, are friends,
    all friends are worth protecting at any cost.'

  (-) Back{300}

{-}GUILDMOTTOS 'GUILD MOTTOS'
~
1 CBLMOTTO~
{100}The Circle of the Black Lotus' Motto:

   'All things exist for a purpose,
    all purposes have hidden, dark secrets,
    all dark secrets can overcome good,
    all things good must be destroyed.'

  (-) Back{300}

{-}GUILDMOTTOS 'GUILD MOTTOS'
~
1 PSIMOTTO~
{130}The Psionicist's Guild Motto:

   'The mind can do anything and everything,
    time and space are ours to command,
    life and death obey our laws,
    superior intellect for superior power.'

  (-) Back{300}

{-}GUILDMOTTOS 'GUILD MOTTOS'
~
1 OJKMOTTO~
{110}The Order of the Jagged Knife's Motto:

   'Observing, examining, calculating,
    preparing, hiding, spying,
    unleashing, attacking, striking,
    cackling, savoring, grinning, next.'

  (-) Back{300}

