#30904
contractor~
The contractor~
The assassin contractor stands here.~
~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_SMART
AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_DETECT_HIDDEN|AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_TONGUES|AFF_ETHEREAL
0 S
99 0 0 1d1+9999 1d1+99
1 838032
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_NEUTRAL
>greet_prog 100~
mpechoat $n To issue a contract, "say contract <target> <amount>".
~
>speech_prog contract~
mpquiet on
mpgoto 30997
mptransfer $n
mpforce $n note to all
mpforce $n note subject Contract: $2 for $3.
mpforce $n note post
mptransfer $n 30996
mpquiet off
mpecho $n issues a new contract.
mpgoto 30996
mpechoat $n Your contract has been posted.
~
|
#30905
guardian~
The guardian~
The guardian of the guild halls is here.~
The guardian is ethereal.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_SMART
AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_DETECT_HIDDEN|AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_TONGUES|AFF_ETHEREAL
