FLAG_CLASS_ASSASSIN
#30966
band wrist adventurer~
an Adventurer's Guild wrist band~
A highly decorated band rests here.~
The Adventurer's Guild Motto:

   'To kill is to live life to the fullest,
    to live a full life includes love,
    to love is to give your heart away,
    to give away your heart is to tempt death,
    to die is the ultimate adventure.'~
ITEM_TYPE_TREASURE
ITEM_FLAG_MAGIC|ITEM_FLAG_NODROP|ITEM_FLAG_NOREMOVE|ITEM_FLAG_INVENTORY|ITEM_FLAG_LEVEL
ITEM_WEAR_TAKE|ITEM_WEAR_WRIST
0 0 0 0
1 0 30
A
APPLY_HITROLL 4
A
APPLY_DAMROLL 4
P 1
TRIG_TICK 60
OPROG_IF OIF_WEAR_LOC = WEAR_NONE 2 4
P 2
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_IF OIF_USER_ROOM_NUM ! 30999 3 0
P 3
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_ECHO
This band was meant to be worn.  Kiss it goodbye.~
P 3
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_JUNK
P 4
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_APPLY OAPPLY_HIT 10
P 4
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_APPLY OAPPLY_MOVE 10
P 4
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_APPLY OAPPLY_MANA 10
P 5
TRIG_UNKNOWN 100 upgrade
OPROG_IF OIF_USER_LEVEL > 50 6 10
P 6
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_IF OIF_USER_ROOM_NUM = 30910 8 7
P 7
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_ECHO You must be in your guildhall to upgrade.~
P 8
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_IF OIF_USER_POSITION < 7 11 9
P 9
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_GOD_COMMAND
say I am upgrading my band now. & mpquiet on &
mpoload 30967 & wear i30967 & mpquiet off~
P 9
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_ECHO You upgrade your guild band.~
P 9
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_JUNK
P 10
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_ECHO You are not powerful enough to upgrade your band yet.~
P 11
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_ECHO You must be fully alert to upgrade.~
