#ROOMS
#30900
Entrance to the Guild Halls~
Welcome!  This is the entrance to the guild halls.  By joining a guild, you
can increase your ability to roleplay, without hindering your ability to
multiplay at the same time.  Of course, each guild does have some drawbacks,
as you will see, but never the less they are a great experience.~
309 ROOM_INDOORS|ROOM_SAFE SECT_INSIDE
DDIR_NORTH
You see the guild hallway.~
~
0 -1 30901
DDIR_SOUTH
You see Ystroth Boulevard.~
~
0 -1 9776
S
#30901
The Guild Hallway~
Here you must decide which guilds you are qualified for.

  Adventurer's Guild:        Must be level 20 or higher.
  Survivalist's Guild:       Must be level 25 or higher.
  League of the White Rose:  Need 30+ levels in monk class (Good/Neut align).
  Circle of the Black Lotus: Must have 30+ levels ill/ele/or nec (Evil align).
  Psionicist's Guild:        Must be level 65+.
  Order of the Jagged Knife: Need to be a pure assassin, level 36+.

Say ADV, SUR, LWR, CBL, PSI, or OJK to learn more about the guilds.~
309 ROOM_INDOORS|ROOM_SAFE SECT_INSIDE
DDIR_SOUTH
You see the entrance.~
~
0 -1 30900
S
#30902
Adventurer's Guild Briefing Room~
The adventurer's guild is a guild for those who wish to explore the depths
of the realm, where players seldom venture.  In return, the adventurer will
occasionally be rewarded with a "token" for his troubles.  Throughout the
realm there are 75 creatures with tokens.  Each token gives the adventurer
a chance to spin the wheel of adventure.  Of course, once you gain all 75
tokens, you cannot gain any more.~
309 ROOM_INDOORS|ROOM_SAFE SECT_INSIDE
DDIR_EAST
You see the guild hallway.~
~
0 -1 30901
S
#30903
Survivalist's Guild Briefing Room~
Survivalists believes that everything they will ever need can be found in
nature.  Whether it be water, food, medicine, or whatever.  Therefore, they
try to avoid the indoor comforts, and live off the land.  Joining the guild
gives you the necessary skills to find food, water, and to create healing
salves.  However, you won't like being inside for any length of time.~
309 ROOM_INDOORS|ROOM_SAFE SECT_INSIDE
DDIR_EAST
You see the guild hallway.~
~
0 -1 30901
S
#30904
League of the White Rose Briefing Room~
The league of the white rose is a guild that provides help to the patrons of
the realm.  When joining the league, you'll be able to call for help from a
holy servant.  The servant will obey your commands, and provide assistance to
you or your comrades when needed, but the servant's duration is limited, as
it must leave its plane of existence to enter yours.  If you turn to an evil
alignment, then you will be zapped by the ring until you return to neutral or
good alignment.~
309 ROOM_INDOORS|ROOM_SAFE SECT_INSIDE
DDIR_DOWN
You see the guild hallway.~
~
0 -1 30901
S
#30905
Circle of the Black Lotus Briefing Room~
Have you ever wanted to just lash out with all your destructive energies and
bring death and disease upon your fellow players?  If so, you're evil! Of 
course, to join the Circle, you need to be evil, so that's a good thing.  Once
a member, you will be able to call upon a winged creature from the depths of 
hell to assist in your destructive actions.  If you ever change to a good
alignment, you will be zapped until you become evil again.~
309 ROOM_INDOORS|ROOM_SAFE SECT_INSIDE
DDIR_UP
You see the guild hallway.~
~
0 -1 30901
S
#30906
Psionicist's Guild Briefing Room~
The psionicist's guild is possibly the most powerful guild.  New skills are
acquired, and can be used by expending psi-points, similar to using mana when
casting spells.  Since a psionicist's source of power comes from the mind,
there is really no way to counterract the skills, but if something goes wrong,
the damage taken can be severe.~
309 ROOM_INDOORS|ROOM_SAFE SECT_INSIDE
DDIR_WEST
You see the guild hallway.~
~
0 -1 30901
S
#30907
Order of the Jagged Knife Briefing Room~
The order of the jagged knife, being a pure assassin guild, is simply an
addition to the skills of the assassin class.  The trick to this guild is that
the longer you stay in it, the better the weapon you will eventually construct.
Also, this guild is a way to unite assassins, as you'll have your own secret
place to read contracts issued by players of the realm.  The first assassin to
fulfill the contract will receive the posted reward.~
309 ROOM_INDOORS|ROOM_SAFE SECT_INSIDE
DDIR_WEST
You see the guild hallway.~
~
0 -1 30901
S
#30910
The Adventurer's Guild~
Welcome to the Adventurer's Guild main building.  If you're not a member
of the guild, I'm afraid you'll have to leave.  Have a nice day.  To the
east you see the main office, and to the west is the lounge.~
309 ROOM_PRIVATE|ROOM_INDOORS|ROOM_SAFE SECT_INSIDE
