#30912
The Adventurer's Lounge~
Woah!  This looks like a great place to relax.  All around you are plush
furniture in assortments of colors and sizes.  There is a nice warm fireplace
against the west wall of the room.  Heck, there's even a note board here so
you can talk with other adventurers.~
309 ROOM_INDOORS|ROOM_SAFE|ROOM_NOTE_BOARD SECT_INSIDE
DDIR_EAST
You see the entrance.~
~
