#30920
The Survivalist's Meadow~
You've entered a beautiful meadow.  Here you see nice green grass, beautiful
weeping willows for shade, and a small bubbling brook running through from 
the east.  This meadow is for survivalist's only though.  To the south you
see a tree where the survivalists congregate.~
309 ROOM_PRIVATE|ROOM_SAFE SECT_CITY
DDIR_NORTH
You see the roads of the realm.~
~
