#30921
The Weeping Willow Tree~
This tree is enormous.  At first you thought it was just an average tree,
but once you walked under the fronds, you discovered it sheltered a vast
region of area.  Here, survivalists have set up small, handmade furnitures
for sitting in and sleeping on, and there is also a note board planted
in the ground where the brook runs through here.~
309 ROOM_SAFE|ROOM_NOTE_BOARD SECT_INN
DDIR_NORTH
You see the entrance to the meadow.~
~
