#30931
The Sacred Altar~
This is where the members of the league can pray for assistance from the
higher beings that hold the realm in balance.  They receive wisdom not
normally gained by those who don't hold life sacred as they do.  There's
a note board here where members can communicate with one another.  The
entrance hallway is east.~
309 ROOM_SAFE|ROOM_INDOORS|ROOM_NOTE_BOARD SECT_INSIDE
DDIR_EAST
You see the entrance hallway.~
~
