#30940
The Black Corridor~
This is the entrance to guild hall of the circle of the black lotus.  The
corridor is dark, as is typical of evil beings.  To the north you spy the
scrying chamber, where the members of the circle plot their evil deeds.  To
the east is the western road of Chakkor.~
