#30941
The Scrying Chamber~
This is where the members of the circle can plot all their evil deeds against
the patrons of the realm.  Those in the circle have absolute hate for members
of the league of the white rose, and usually tend to plot their demise.
There's a note board here where members can communicate with one another.  To
the south is the entrance corridor.~
309 ROOM_SAFE|ROOM_INDOORS|ROOM_NOTE_BOARD SECT_INSIDE
DDIR_SOUTH
You see the entrance corridor.~
~
