#30950
The Hovering Steps~
This is odd.  You're on some steps but they don't seem to be supported by
anything.  Then you remember the tales of the people who once made things
levitate with their minds.  That must be it.  Down from here you can see
the eastern business district of Chakkor.  East is the psionic chamber.~
