#30951
The Psionic Chamber~
Woah.  You enter this room and feel all kinds of thoughts and ideas rush
into your mind.  Like this is one massive brain providing you with energy.
That's because this is the psionic chamber, the main gathering room for
members of the Psionicist's Guild.  There's a note board here where members
can communicate with each other.  To the west are the floating steps.~
309 ROOM_SAFE|ROOM_INDOORS|ROOM_NOTE_BOARD SECT_INSIDE
DDIR_WEST
You see the floating steps.~
