#30960
The Dark Tunnel~
This tunnel leads to the secret gathering room for the order of the jagged 
knife.  Due to the hatred between patrons of the realm and assassins, the
location of this place is a well-guarded secret.  To the east you see the
main gathering bar of the assassins.~
