#30961
The Bar~
This bar has long been closed, but its location being forgotten for so many 
years makes it the perfect gathering place for assassins.  Here they can 
discuss the contracts they've had, and explain in detail the thrill of the 
hunts they've been on.  To the south is the list of contracts posted by 
players of the realm.  A note board is tacked to the wall in here also, so 
members of the order can communicate with one another.  The entrance hallway 
is to the west.~
309 ROOM_SAFE|ROOM_INDOORS|ROOM_NOTE_BOARD SECT_INSIDE
DDIR_SOUTH
You see the contract room.~
~
