#30996
Assassin Contracting Room~
Welcome to the assassin contracting room.  Here you can submit a contract
to the order of the jagged knife.  If someone in the order decides to fulfil
that contract, and kill the person you request, they will get in touch with
you and discuss any necessary details.  No one can read the contract except
for the assassins of the order.~
309 ROOM_INDOORS|ROOM_SAFE SECT_INSIDE
DDIR_EAST
You see an alley.~
~
