S
#30997
The Contract Room~
This is where you can find the contracts from players of the realm. You are 
required to keep all information on contracts confidential, and are only to 
discuss terms with the contracting player.  To fulfill a contract, you, the 
contracting player, and the victim should all be logged in, so that there is 
no doubt when the contract is fulfilled.~
309 ROOM_NO_MOB|ROOM_INDOORS|ROOM_SAFE|ROOM_NOTE_BOARD SECT_INSIDE
DDIR_NORTH
You see the bar.~
~
