#30999
The Room of Wearing~
In this room you MUST wear your new guild band or ring.  If you do not wear it
while in this room, it will vanish, and you will NOT be able to join another
guild.  It is YOUR responsibility to read all directions and obey all rules of
the guild, for there are no reimbursements for problems encountered.~
309 ROOM_INDOORS|ROOM_SAFE|ROOM_NO_RECALL SECT_INSIDE
DDIR_NORTH
You see Patrokles Avenue.~
~
